## WHAT THIS PROJECT IS
- **EL Python Port**: Faithful Python port of n8n workflows (`legacy/EL.json`) for e-commerce product discovery + HIL (Human-in-the-Loop) pipeline
- **Phase 3 SaaS**: Full end-to-end SaaS build (SP1\u2013SP9)
- **Stack**: Python 3.12, Supabase/PostgreSQL+pgvector, Vertex AI/Gemini, Docker, FastAPI, n8n
- **Deployed**: Docker Compose on laptop + Cloudflare Quick Tunnel. `/healthz` green.

