## PROJECT STRUCTURE KEY:
- `el/` \u2014 core Python package (pipeline, nodes, providers, web API)
- `legacy/` \u2014 original n8n workflows (source of truth)
- `migrations/` \u2014 SQL migrations for Supabase
- `scripts/` \u2014 build, calibration, verification, deploy scripts
- `tests/` \u2014 804+ pytest tests, 90%+ coverage
- `docs/superpowers/specs/` \u2014 SP design specifications
- `docs/superpowers/plans/` \u2014 SP implementation plans
- `docs/runbooks/` \u2014 operational runbooks (deploy, shopify, etc)
- `paper/` \u2014 academic paper (LaTeX)
- `gui/` \u2014 Windows desktop GUI (CustomTkinter), single-file .exe wrapper

## COMMANDS:
```powershell
# Run tests
.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pytest tests/ -q

# Preview trends
.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m el trends --top 10 --json

# Forge supplier preview
.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m el forge --query "RCB jersey" --json

# Sentinel preview (Forge + vetting + HIL bridge)
.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m el sentinel --query "RCB jersey" --json

# Verify env
.venv\Scripts\python.exe scripts\verify_env.py

# Docker compose
docker compose up -d

# Build GUI .exe (from repo root)
.\gui\build.ps1
```

